SUMMARY:Leadership on Tap
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nYou will understand\, at a deeper level\, 
 how your nervous system works\, why it makes the decisions it does\, and w
 hy it creates the illusions that shape your experience.\n\nYou will walk a
 way with three distinct tools: one that helps you recognize the illusion\,
  one that drops you back into alignment\, and one that primes your brain t
 o create opportunities in alignment with your values and your abundance.\n
 \n## This is capacity training\, not treatment. **Nothing is being fixed.*
 *\n\n**New capacity is being built. It is not biofeedback as it has existe
 d before.**\n\n#### Traditional biofeedback shows you numbers.\n\n#### **X
 Regulation is the first instrument that allows the nervous system to obser
 ve itself directly.**\n\n#### Not as data.\n\n#### As experience.\n\n#### 
 **A new category of human technology has emerged.**\n\n### Every pattern y
 our nervous system runs made sense at one point in time. None of it needs 
 to be fought. What changes when the system can finally see itself — clea
 rly\, in real time\, without judgment — is not a performance improvement
 .\n\n### **It is a different relationship with being alive.**\n\n*LOCATION
  Change - Hatch CoWorking*\nWho's welcome?\n\nEveryone! Whether you're lea
 ding in for-profit\, non-profit\, academia\, community organizations\, or 
 entrepreneurship – or simply curious about leadership – you're welcome
  to join us.\n\n* Hatch Coworking\n* Parking: Street parking is free after
  6 pm\n* Beverages: Alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages
