SUMMARY:Sip\, Snack\, and Scout: ADN Takes Over 7Acres
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nLet’s be honest. Your living room walls 
 are starting to talk back\, and your houseplants are terrible conversation
 alists. It is time to reclaim your social capital and see what the future 
 of flexible work actually looks like.\n\nJoin AVL Digital Nomads as we cel
 ebrate the finale of our two free coworking days with an evening social mi
 xer at the brand-new Workspace at 7Acres.\n\nMost places give you one thin
 g\, like a desk and a sad coffee maker. 7Acres is doing something entirely
  different. They are launching a visionary space built around the idea tha
 t work\, play\, recovery\, and connection are all critical to a life well 
 lived. This isn't just a gym co-located next to an office. It is one organ
 ization\, one intention\, and one community intentionally designed to make
  every part of your day better.\n\nYou can learn all about the grand visio
 n during your visit\, but this night is mostly about kicking back.\n\n**Wh
 at is on tap?**\n\n* **The Fuel:** Enjoy complimentary adult beverages and
  light snacks while you mingle.\n* **The Grand Tour:** Get a firsthand loo
 k at the first phase of this exciting new concept.\n* **The Loot:** We are
  hosting raffles for 7Acres memberships alongside some excellent discount 
 opportunities.\n\nJust want to chill? You are completely welcome to simply
  show up\, grab a drink\, and enjoy the vibe. There is no pressure to talk
  shop. This is a welcoming\, interesting venue designed for real human con
 nection.\n\nCome hang out\, explore the venue\, and connect with your fell
 ow nomads. We can't wait to see you there.\n\n**ADN Pirani Cups available*
 *\nCelebrate our 5th anniversary with our customized [ADN Pirani cups](htt
 ps://avldigitalnomads.org/meet-our-brand-new-customized-adn-pirani-mugs/)!
  Available in 16oz\, 26oz\, and 32oz sizes\, you can purchase yours direct
 ly at this event.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315231678/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260612T170344Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260612T170344Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
