DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260707T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260707T193000
SUMMARY:AVL Digital Nomads - Book Club!
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**July Meeting - Book Swap & Planning!**\n
 \n* Bring books that you would like to swap with other book club participa
 nts.\n* We encourage active participation in choosing our reading material
 . Bring your book suggestions for planning. We’ll plan out the next 6 mo
 nths of selections.\n\n**Welcome** to our robust and engaging Book Club! W
 e're a small\, friendly group dedicated to fostering lively discussions ab
 out our monthly book selections. Whether you've read the entire book\, jus
 t a few chapters\, or even if you're simply curious about the title\, we'd
  love to have you join us!\n\n**Meeting Schedule**: We gather on the First
  Tuesday of every month for our book discussions.\n\nWhat sets us apart is
  our small group size and directed discussions. This intimate setting allo
 ws for deeper\, more engaging conversations where everyone's voice can be 
 heard. It's the perfect environment for those who love to dive deep into t
 hemes\, characters\, and the intricacies of storytelling.\n\nSo whether yo
 u're a seasoned bookworm or just dipping your toes into the world of liter
 ature\, we invite you to join us. Let's explore new worlds\, challenge our
  perspectives\, and forge new friendships - one book at a time!\n\n**Augus
 t Pick: *TBD***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/312930477/
